omy, clearance, mass or receiver capacity. If no supported actuator/path/retention response or conserved output partition exists, the executable precursor ends with the specific missing physical prerequisite and unchanged inputs except actual paid examination effects; no fictional contact or separation animation. This is a development boundary, not permanent rejection.\\\\nFor a supported quote, begin reserves only exact required objects and receiver space, records the initial source revision and placement, and permits one active contact round costing at most 1 energy and abstract effort 1. No heat, water, consumables or additional stock is supplied. A stone actuator is permitted only if the inherited contact model supports this nonimpact use; quote a maximum blunting increment of 0.002 and no fracture/material loss under that bounded model, otherwise do not execute that method. Quote a maximum displacement no greater than 0.02 world units, further limited by measured clearance and reach; uncertainty that prevents safe path validation blocks contact. A single-attempt ledger is source-state-bound and survives cancellation and re-pickup; unchanged re-assessment cannot replenish it. Actual separation is conditional, never guaranteed. Commit payment, contact, wear, resulting physical state and event atomically. Unsupported change, inadequate energy, loss of reach or conflicting reservation pauses before any next charge.\\\\nRetain quantity 1 as the parent assembly unless an actual source allocation supports separation. At separation, partition the existing conserved source ledger between residual assembly and detached output: parent and child allocations sum exactly to the prior allocation, including retained, deposited and recoverable portions; never leave a full counted parent plus added contents. Unknown physical mass stays unknown. If the inventory format cannot represent a supported fraction, preserve it as source-linked recoverable physical material rather than rounding it into a new whole item. No disappearance, free debris, automatic pickup or automatic transfer to inventory. Record exact output provenance, actual receiver/location, accessibility and any measured damage. Recovery is a separate actual reachable action using an applicable existing pickup/recovery function; unsupported fractional recovery remains explicitly unresolved. Outputs are unidentified separated specimen material, not food or certified safe products.\\\\nPersist process ID, quote, source revisions, reservations, paid work and effects. Resume revalidates conditions without recharging completed work or repeating committed contact. Cancel, interruption and death preserve irreversible changes and surviving products at their actual locations; release this process's locks exactly once, never another process's locks. Before payment there is no work charge; paid study, examination, contact and wear are not refunded. No resource escrow is consumed merely by reservation; any reserved surviving matter is released in place, not remotely returned. Ordinary ageing continues; no passive work, automatic maintenance, repeated contact, regeneration or free condition restoration. No execution, study or world-time advancement occurs while development/review is waiting. Actual acquisition, movement and any other participant's communication or assistance require their own independent actions. Established validation, costs, conservation and stop rules execute in code rather than repeated model review.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Evaluate experience independently of physical success. Only an actual paid examination or contact yielding personally applicable, verified new physical information may invoke the existing grounded-understanding rule, including informative physical failure. If available and applicable, retain its short source amount 0.8, cap 1, duration 8 rounds, cooldown 12 rounds, maintained gain 0.035 and decay 0.0015; otherwise award zero 